  m_Text: "<b>Green:</b> Gas pedal \t\t\t<b>Red:</b> Brake pedal\n<b>Lime:</b> Engine
    load\t\t\t<b>Orange:</b> Handbrake\n\n<b>Blue:</b> Clutch pedal\n<b>Alt blue:</b>
    Transmission de-coupling (clutch, torque converter)\n\n<b>Cyan:</b> Steering
    wheel input\n<b>Gray:</b> Assisted steering"
